The Hunters Guild              NannyMUD Times                        Page 14

The Hunters Guild has been re-opened!

Davy Crockett, the frontiersman, has set up a trading post
in the Woodlands area on the east side of Vincent's Valley.
He is currently recruting bold young adventurers to join his
guild of Hunters.

Applicants must be level 1-3 with no more than 6500 exp.
They will need a minimum of 1000 gc to buy a guild knife,
but if they want to buy hunter clothing and extra training,
5000 gc is recommended.  They must also be neutral.

-Astrodeath                                   Page 14                                  
